  "name": "WF1 — Cleaner Schedule [FIXED + Annotated]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WF1: Cleaner Schedule & Mid-Month Alerts\nPurpose: Keeps the cleaning team synced with the booking calendar.\nTriggers: Runs automatically on the 1st of every month (8:00 AM) and checks every 2 hours.\nActions:\n\nCompiles all checkouts for the current month and sends a master schedule via WhatsApp/Telegram.\n\nScans for any brand-new bookings added mid-month and alerts the cleaner within 4 hours to update their schedule",
